  "id": "BIT-gitlab-2026-15723",
  "summary": "Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an LDAP Query ('LDAP Injection') in GitLab",
  "details": "GitLab has remediated an issue in GitLab CE/EE affecting all versions from 10.1 before 19.3.6, 19.4 before 19.4.3, and 19.5 before 19.5.1 that, when OmniAuth SAML and LDAP auto-linking were both enabled, an authenticated user could have taken over an existing LDAP-backed account without any interaction from the targeted user, due to improper input sanitization in the LDAP email lookup path used during OmniAuth identity linking.",
